      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We report a rare case of an intraosseous talar pseudotumour associated with hyperuricaemia in a previously asymptomatic patient, treated with curettage and bone autograft. Satisfactory function and pain relief was obtained at 6 months follow up with no evidence of recurrent disease."
      },
